      "explain": "The question is decomposed into up to 3 sub-questions that together cover what's needed to answer it. If the LLM's response was malformed, empty, or not a list, this falls back to treating the original question as the sole sub-question rather than proceeding with zero sub-questions.",
      "payload": {
        "sub_questions": [
          "Which components of a model are frozen when applying LoRA (Low-Rank Adaptation)?",
